---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
const instagram = "https://www.instagram.com/scribbledtoday/";
---
<SiteLayout title="Work With Me, ScribbledToday" description="Enquiries for commissioned creative work, performances, sound sessions and collaborations.">
  <main><div class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">For organisers · Curators · Collaborators</div><h1>Have a thought, a brief or an <em>invitation?</em></h1><p>ScribbledToday is also a space to begin something together. If you are planning an event, looking for a performer or exploring a creative collaboration, let's start a conversation.</p></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="eyebrow">Ways to collaborate</div><h2 class="section-title">What we could create together.</h2><div class="card-grid">
    <div class="work-card"><div class="card-meta"><span>01 / Create</span></div><div><h2>Commissioned work</h2><p>Writing, poetry and creative contributions shaped around a brief or an idea.</p></div></div>
    <div class="work-card"><div class="card-meta"><span>02 / Perform</span></div><div><h2>Performances</h2><p>Handpan, poetry and performance opportunities for events and gatherings.</p></div></div>
    <div class="work-card"><div class="card-meta"><span>03 / Facilitate</span></div><div><h2>Sessions & experiences</h2><p>Sound baths and group experiences designed around listening, pause and presence.</p></div></div>
    <div class="work-card"><div class="card-meta"><span>04 / Collaborate</span></div><div><h2>Creative partnerships</h2><p>Festivals, workshops, storytelling, community events and cross-disciplinary projects.</p></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="enquiry"><div class="eyebrow">Let's talk</div><h2>Tell me what you're imagining.</h2><p class="muted">For now, the easiest way to reach me is through Instagram. You can share the event or project, proposed date, location and the kind of collaboration you have in mind. A dedicated email/contact form can be added when you choose the address you want to publish.</p><a class="btn primary" href={instagram} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Send an enquiry on Instagram ↗</a></div></section></main>
</SiteLayout>
